          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "毎晩のようにかかってきていた無言電話が、警察に相談した途端にプツリと鳴り止んだ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "動画のストリーミング再生中、Wi-Fiの接続が切れて映像がプツリと止まってしまった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "賑やかだったセミの鳴き声が、夕立の気配とともにプツリと途絶えた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "piercing (e.g. with a needle)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "ピアッサーを使って、耳たぶにプツリと小さな穴を開けた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "予防接種の注射針が二の腕にプツリと入り、思わず目をギュッと閉じた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "待ち針をピンクッションにプツリ、プツリと一定のリズムで刺して片付けていく。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "gloss": "squashing (something small; e.g. an insect)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "腕に止まって血を吸っていた蚊を、手のひらでプツリと叩き潰した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "葉っぱの裏にびっしり付いていたアブラムシを、指先でプツリと潰して駆除した。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "梱包用のプチプチを、暇つぶしに一つずつプツリと潰して遊んでいた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 5,
        "gloss": "breaking out (e.g. of a pimple)",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "ストレスが胃腸にきているのか、口の周りに吹き出物がプツリとできている。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "朝起きて顔を洗おうとしたら、顎のラインにニキビがプツリと発生していてショックだった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "季節の変わり目になると、肌が荒れて頬に赤いデキモノがプツリと現れる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      }
